    "custom_liquid_JFjFRt": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div id=\"toggleBtnTop\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 0; display: inline-block; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px; user-select: none;\">\n  Know More\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"faqs\" style=\"padding:15px 0; display:none; background: transparent; border:none;\">\n\n  <style>\n    /* 统一控制文章内的标题与正文比例 */\n    #faqs h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem !important; /* 主标题大小 */\n      margin-top: 1rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.2 !important;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs h2 {\n      font-size: 1.25rem !important; /* 副标题大小 */\n      margin-top: 1.5rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.3 !important;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs p, #faqs li {\n      font-size: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.6 !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n    #faqs table td {\n      padding: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n    .horizontal-scroll-wrapper {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    /* 表格样式美化 */\n    #faqs table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    #faqs thead tr {\n      background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h1 data-path-to-node=\"3\">The Complete Guide to Light Switches: From Classic Designs to Smart Solutions</h1>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Choosing the right <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"19\"><a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/light-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">light switch</a></b> is about more than just turning on a bulb—it’s about matching your home’s interior design with the right electrical functionality. From traditional toggles to advanced automation, explore our comprehensive range of high-quality switching solutions.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">1. Understanding Switch Types: Gangs &amp; Ways</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The most common confusion in lighting starts with \"Gangs\" and \"Ways.\"</p>\n\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n    <li><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">1 Gang vs. Multi-Gang:</b> A \"gang\" refers to the number of switches on a single plate. We offer everything from minimalist <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-brass-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1-gang designs</a> to high-capacity <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4-gang smart switches</a>.</li>\n    <li><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">2-Way Switching:</b> Essential for hallways or stairs, a 2-way switch allows you to control one light from two different locations.</li>\n    <li><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">Intermediate Switches:</b> Used when you need to control a single light from three or more locations.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">2. Smart Light Switches &amp; Home Automation</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Modern homes are moving towards connectivity. According to UK search trends, <b>Zigbee and WiFi switches</b> are the top choice for energy-conscious homeowners.</p>\n\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n    <li><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\">WiFi Integration:</b> Control your home via app or voice with our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-room-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Room Thermostat</a> and smart lighting ecosystem.</li>\n    <li><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\">No-Neutral Solutions:</b> Many older UK homes lack a neutral wire at the switch. Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-for-retractive-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer for Retractive Switch</a> and <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer Modules</a> are designed to provide smart features even in traditional wiring setups.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3. Premium Finishes &amp; Aesthetic Series</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"14\">A light switch is a tactile part of your home you touch every day. We believe it should feel as good as it looks.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"horizontal-scroll-wrapper\">\n    <table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>Series</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Material</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Best For</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Link</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Solid Brass</b></td>\n          <td>Genuine Brass</td>\n          <td>Period properties &amp; luxury</td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-brass-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Collection</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Solid Steel</b></td>\n          <td>Brushed Steel</td>\n          <td>Modern & industrial</td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Collection</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Black Steel</b></td>\n          <td>Matte Black</td>\n          <td>Contemporary interiors</td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-black-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Collection</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>White Steel</b></td>\n          <td>Powder Coated</td>\n          <td>Minimalist spaces</td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-white-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Collection</a></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">4. Professional Installation Components</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"18\">For contractors and DIY enthusiasts, having the right internal components is key to a long-lasting installation.</p>\n\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n    <li><b>Control Hubs:</b> Manage complex zones with our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wiring-center-8-channel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8-Channel Wiring Center</a>.</li>\n    <li><b>Retractive Switches:</b> Perfect for smart modules, our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-for-retractive-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dimmer for retractive switch</a> provides a sleek \"push\" interaction.</li>\n    <li><b>Thermostat Alternatives:</b> Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-thermostat-an-alternative-to-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Thermostat (Alternative to Nest)</a> offers premium features at a better value.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\">FAQs</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"22\"><strong>What is the difference between a 1-way and a 2-way light switch?</strong></p>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"23\">A 1-way switch controls a light from a single location. A 2-way switch is used in a pair to control the same light from two different locations, like stairs.</p>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"24\"><strong>Can I replace a standard switch with a smart switch?</strong></p>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"25\">Yes! Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-steel-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer Steel Series</a> is designed to fit standard UK back boxes.</p>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"26\"><strong>Do I need a specific switch for underfloor heating?</strong></p>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Yes, we recommend our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/wifi-wireless-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WiFi Wireless Thermostat</a> for maximum precision.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Explore All Solutions</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Not sure what you need? Browse our <b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/all-products\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">All Products Collection</a></b> or visit our <b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Homepage</a></b>.</p>\n\n  <div id=\"toggleBtnBottom\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 0; display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 300;\">\n    Show Less\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function toggleFaq() {\n    const content = document.getElementById('faqs');\n    const topBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtnTop');\n\n    if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n      content.style.display = \"block\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      content.style.display = \"none\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n      window.scrollTo({ top: topBtn.offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    }\n  }\n</script>",
